      "indicator": "EMP_TEMP_SEX_INS_DSB_NB",
      "indicator.label": "Employment by sex, public/private sector and disability status (thousands)",
      "indicator.description": "The employed comprise all persons of working age who were in paid employment or self-employment. For more information, refer to the &lt;a href = \"https://ilostat.ilo.org/methods/concepts-and-definitions/description-labour-force-statistics/\"&gt;Labour Force Statistics (LFS) database description&lt;/a&gt;.</p>"
